X:1
T:Sokhi Bhabona Kahare Bole
C:Rabindranath Tagore
S:notes: data/raw_data/midi/rs001964.mid (Geetabitan, arranged by Anjan Ganguly), violin track
S:lyrics: data/raw_data/text/lyrics/rs001964.txt (Geetabitan transliteration)
S:alignment: data/raw_data/swaralipi/rs001964.pdf (Geetabitan swaralipi)
N:Notes quantized to 16ths, pitch bends applied (scripts/midi_to_ktab.py read_tracks). Sa = C; komal Ni (A#) and Ni (B), Ma shuddha (F) with one tivra Ma (F#, bar 12).
N:Form played by the MIDI: sthayi; then five parts (Aamar chokhe to, Taara keboli, Phul se haasite, Aamar maton, Protidin), each with its first two lines twice; the first two lines of the sthayi to end.
N:Where a swaralipi cell holds only a word's last consonant (tom-ra, cho-kher, bi-shad, din) that note is a hold. "aamari" has two notes in the MIDI and is written aa-mari.
N:Syllables placed on the notes as in the swaralipi; one swaralipi matra = one quarter note.
